{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">INCOMING MESSAGE FROM THE ADMINISTRATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attention Operator, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have been selected to oversee a critical mission. Our team of elite soldiers is set to descend into a newly discovered abyss, believed to lead to uncharted territories beneath the earth. Your role is to monitor the soldiers' progress, ensuring their safety and collecting data. <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895680/extras/TerminalsNarrowOprimize.gif?t=1745164655\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895680/extras/EOL_No_Glow.png?t=1745164655\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As they venture deeper, remain vigilant and provide guidance based on their transmissions. You will have access to a status monitor, a radar, a radio to scan various frequencies, and other equipment to assist in your mission.<br>Be aware that communication may become sporadic as they descend. Strange anomalies have already been detected, and the nature of the abyss remains unknown. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895680/extras/InspectNarrowOptimize.gif?t=1745164655\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895680/extras/EOL_No_Glow.png?t=1745164655\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for the unexpected and maintain operational readiness at all times. Prepare to face the unimaginable. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">End of message.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895680/extras/Cintas-large.gif?t=1745164655\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"