uipment to assist in your mission.<br>Be aware that communication may become sporadic as they descend. Strange anomalies have already been detected, and the nature of the abyss remains unknown. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895680/extras/InspectNarrowOptimize.gif?t=1745164655\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895680/extras/EOL_No_Glow.png?t=1745164655\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for the unexpected and maintain operational readiness at all times. Prepare to face the unimaginable. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">End of message.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895680/extras/Cintas-large.gif?t=1745164655\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895680/extras/EOF_No_Glow.png?t=1745164655\" /></p>","developers":["FromSouthGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895680/332bcf89d0a06c3791f3f8d4f2764b2ff4b6b2e5/header.jpg?t=1745164655","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257052229,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257052229/movie480.mp4?t=1745163444","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257052229/movie_max.mp4